<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμβᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβαίνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			) <i>bringing one foot up to the other</i>, in walking,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>juncture</i> of ribs, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβαίνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>agreement, arrangement, treaty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβάσιες . . οὐκ ἐθέλουσι συμμένειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					739
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δὸς σύμβασιν τέκνοις</span> make
			them friends, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ξ. παῖδα ἄγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					423
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ξ. ἐγένετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ ξυμβάσεως</span> by
				<i>agreement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβαίνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			) <i>conjunction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				359b
			</span></i>; <i>concurrence, coincidence</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβάσεως ἔξω πάσης καὶ συνθέσεως</span>, said of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἕν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				5.4.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.1.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.8.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ σύμβασιν</span>, technical
			term of the Empirics, expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.164
			</span></i>.</div>
